Subject: potd: default the Picture of the Day wallpaper to the Bing provider

The Astronomy Picture of the Day provider reads https://apod.nasa.gov/apod/,
which redirects to a page with none of the image links the provider looks
for, so a wallpaper left at an apod default shows no picture. Bing's
provider loads.

--- a/wallpapers/potd/package/contents/config/main.xml
+++ b/wallpapers/potd/package/contents/config/main.xml
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
   <group name="General">
     <entry name="Provider" type="String">
       <label>Provider of Picture of the Day</label>
-      <default>apod</default>
+      <default>bing</default>
     </entry>
     <entry name="FillMode" type="int">
       <label>Sizing, cropping and positioning of the wallpaper image</label>
